  </MentalStateDef>

  <AbilityDef>
    <defName>FG_FairysGate</defName>
    <label>Fairy's Gate</label>
    <description>DO NOT OPEN FAIRY'S GATE.

The carrier can tear open a passage to the realm of fairies. Psychic power floods through the breach, answering the questions gnawing at their mind.

Opening the Gate is fatal. The resulting psychic blast is weaker than the final eruption, but can still kill anyone nearby. It burns all psyfocus; its radius and damage grow with psychic sensitivity and the psyfocus burned.

The Gate takes 10 seconds to open. Once it has begun, nothing but death can stop it.</description>
    <iconPath>FairyGenes/UI/Ability_FairysGate</iconPath>
    <!-- Downed but conscious, it opens straight from the button (no casting job). -->
    <gizmoClass>FairyGenes.Command_FairysGate</gizmoClass>
    <aiCanUse>false</aiCanUse>
    <targetRequired>false</targetRequired>
    <displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>true</displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>
    <disableGizmoWhileUndrafted>false</disableGizmoWhileUndrafted>
    <hostile>false</hostile>
    <casterMustBeCapableOfViolence>false</casterMustBeCapableOfViolence>
    <verbProperties>
      <verbClass>Verb_CastAbility</verbClass>
      <!-- No warm-up (here and on the flutter dash): a save made mid warm-up keeps the ability's verb in the pawn's stance,
           and without Fairycore that pawn would be stuck forever (Stance_Warmup with a null verb). -->
      <warmupTime>0</warmupTime>
      <requireLineOfSight>false</requireLineOfSight>
      <drawAimPie>false</drawAimPie>
      <targetable>false</targetable>
      <targetParams>
        <canTargetSelf>true</canTargetSelf>
      </targetParams>
    </verbProperties>
    <comps>
      <li Class="FairyGenes.CompProperties_AbilityFairysGate" />
    </comps>
  </AbilityDef>

  <!-- Fairy's Gate opening: 10 s, committed; the Time Leap effect fades in (Hediff_FairysGateOpening). -->
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>FG_FairysGateOpening</defName>
    <label>opening Fairy's Gate</label>
